\":\"Madonna returns to the MTV VMAs stage after 23 years, Taylor Swift set to make history: Everything to know about the 2026 awards show\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/music/article/madonna-returns-to-the-mtv-vmas-stage-after-23-years-taylor-swift-set-to-make-history-everything-to-know-about-the-2026-awards-show-195916071.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":391,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"attribution\":{\"authorImage\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"originalHeight\":500,\"originalUrl\":\"https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-06/ed03d3b0-5106-11f0-bfb7-fec9056d890d\",\"originalWidth\":500,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f6cee877ed7a360b593f789f71e5df2b229ac5c595acb78b33126066af2aed17/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2025-06%2Fed03d3b0-5106-11f0-bfb7-fec9056d890d\",\"width\":80}]},\"authors\":[\"Danica Creahan\"],\"brandAlias\":\"yahoo_entertainment\",\"brandUuid\":\"351139d9-3c97-32df-b6d0-17472b562146\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Yahoo\",\"originalHeight\":667,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/40285560-3db7-11f0-8cef-1ceddb7a473f_4101.png_7371d47347a9a0e836595c5ee438601a786d110bfbd4efd4913c80421567e02b.png\",\"originalWidth\":667,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/950f7c70e9a5f5a7b6ebb3c4ddfbfc91487f5a6de5ba4806923c674608aa1dfb/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2F40285560-3db7-11f0-8cef-1ceddb7a473f_4101.png_7371d47347a9a0e836595c5ee438601a786d110bfbd4efd4913c80421567e02b.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":true,\"providerBrandId\":\"351139d9-3c97-32df-b6d0-17472b562146\",\"providerSourceId\":\"wp