he most influential communities ranging from billionaires, business leaders and rising entrepreneurs to creators and innovators.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"3836d5f0-94bb-3692-8d36-77810d40aaef-1790498359454\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"3836d5f0-94bb-3692-8d36-77810d40aaef\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:15:44Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"How revenue sharing, NIL money and the transfer portal are changing college basketball and making it harder for mid-majors to retain talent.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"NCAA Oklahoma UConn Basketball\",\"originalHeight\":639,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/forbes_contributor_845/07c3a209642bd36fcd6d9f62f92f5bdd.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":959,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ee2a6f8f0e49367e157a8f2386549d84709c693301c2dc09c87945e14d8ae90b/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fforbes_contributor_845%2F07c3a209642bd36fcd6d9f62f92f5bdd.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/61d423da68407a563ac85a562a5a8af75e20d750ba3215258bb7ead8c0b24b71/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fforbes_contributor_845%2F07c3a209642bd36fcd6d9f62f92f5bdd.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"What Makes A College Basketball Player Valuable In The NIL Era\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/makes-college-basketball-player-valuable-081544007.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":350,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Geoffrey Seiler, The Motley Fool\"],\"brandAlias\":\"motley_fool\",\"brandUuid\":\"76f060fb-54cd-3b1e-b8f9-7ac0cd1c1ec7\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"originalHeight\":400,\"originalUrl\":\"https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2020-12/31cda7c0-367f-11eb-aadf-828e242f0e04\",\"originalWidth\":400,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fb67095ca1535f632c9960520102d2604d0de097a16503d991593fcbc95e3098/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2020-12%2F31cda7c0-367f-11eb-aadf-828e242f0e04\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"76f060fb-54cd-3b1e-b8f9-7ac0cd1c1ec7\",\"providerSourceId\":\"motleyfool.com\",\"showBrandPage\":false,\"source\":\"Motley Fool\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/motley-fool/\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"BUSINESS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"21ebada8-e1f2-3fe9-a328-f2099d6e893d-1790498359454\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Business\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"21ebada8-e1f2-3fe9-a328-f2099d6e893d\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:15:00Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"While Buffett has never owned Nvidia, the stock has several traits that fit his approach.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Warren Buffett.\",\"originalHeight\":978,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/motleyfool.com/4a62c697a225cae6b8024703054406d0.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1400,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cf23034de4341d5befe80782c77bfa3747dff3219d36d36996f5ea90bc23457d/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmotleyfool.com%2F4a62c697a225cae6b8024703054406d0.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d394abf1012f34b4d4258fa75f37cc41c8d072d7acc1547982c939d675d53023/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmotleyfool.com%2F4a62c697a225cae6b8024703054406d0.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"3 Reasons Why Nvidia Fits Warren Buffett's Investment Style\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/3-reasons-why-nvidia-fits-081500621.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":256,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"aiSummary\":[{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Americans are among the most likely to feel more worried than hopeful about artificial intelligence, according to a new Gallup survey.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Globally, AI is more often seen as beneficial than harmful, with median awareness of AI tools at 81% and median daily use at 43%.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Concern about AI appears to be a uniquely Western phenomenon, with countries like the U.S., Egypt, and Palestine recording more negative than positive feelings about the technology.\"}],\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Jennifer Green\"],\"brandAlias\":\"the_cool_down\",\"brandUuid\":\"063dff55-2c1a-3c9d-b2de-17888f26264f\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"TCD logo\",\"caption\":\"TCD logo\",\"originalHeight\":480,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/TCD_Yahoo_Logo.png_fec93c8f2366e33444d5a8e07af47b9e2a807bc7a246ad3e936916fdd92340f9.png\",\"originalWidth\":480,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6eedd107de236293cb6776323314c52b3677740ea23c47ad69a25bfaa8fe5709/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2FTCD_Yahoo_Logo.png_fec93c8f2366e33444d5a8e07af47b9e2a807bc7a246ad3e936916fdd92340f9.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"063dff55-2c1a-3c9d-b2de-17888f26264f\",\"providerSourceId\":\"the_cool_down_737\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"The Cool Down\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/the-cool-down/\",\"description\":\"The Cool Down is America's mainstream guide to a cleaner, cooler future, making it easy for people from all walks of life to help themselves while helping the planet.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"TECHNOLOGY\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"897e649f-7282-3976-b923-d4725e9b86be-1790498359454\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Technology\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"897e649f-7282-3976-b923-d4725e9b86be\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:15:00Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"More frequent use was generally linked with greater trust in AI.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Survey finds AI optimism worldwide, but the US is one of few countries where negativity leads\",\"originalHeight\":1080,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/the_cool_down_737/cfd9cc867bc12ed41514511567cb7dd9.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1920,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/51e74d6c332044813b262e7dced2fdc2be667daa728cbbc053ddd139e7a795c4/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fthe_cool_down_737%2Fcfd9cc867bc12ed41514511567cb7dd9.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/68d7523c596a7049c7711dae72c44ce7cbaa5fcff21b4fe683e1e0987f938be0/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fthe_cool_down_737%2Fcfd9cc867bc12ed41514511567cb7dd9.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"Survey finds AI optimism worldwide, but the US is one of few countries where negativity leads\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://tech.yahoo.com/ai/articles/survey-finds-ai-optimism-worldwide-081500910.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":171,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"aiSummary\":[{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Mike Tomlin compares Josh Allen's Super Bowl struggles to Peyton Manning's early career, highlighting Allen's MVP award and strong start to the 2026 season.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"NFL fans are divided over Tomlin's comparison, with some expressing doubt about Allen's ability to win a Super Bowl and others questioning Tomlin's analysis.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"The debate surrounding Allen's potential playoff success continues, with some fans expressing optimism while others remain sceptical about Buffalo's chances this season.\"}],\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Aryan Chadha\"],\"brandAlias\":\"hitc\",\"brandUuid\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"HITC Logo\",\"caption\":\"HITC Logo\",\"originalHeight\":480,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/hitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"originalWidth\":480,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6db83a642c866802d185948d53aaac192f9ba39995d8e7a19b281ff573de486e/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fhitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"providerSourceId\":\"hitc_articles_832\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"HITC\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/hitc/\",\"description\":\"HITC is a British sport news website focused primarily on football, with coverage extending to Formula 1, NBA, Tennis, and Golf. It was formerly known as Here Is the City and focused on financial news and entertainment before switching to sport in 2023.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"974a458f-7505-38f6-aeeb-4b3f70d59522-1790498359454\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"974a458f-7505-38f6-aeeb-4b3f70d59522\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:15:00Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"Mike Tomlin’s latest defence of Josh Allen has left NFL fans divided after the former Pittsburgh Steelers coach compared the Buffalo Bills quarterback’s Super Bowl struggles to Peyton Manning’s early career. Tomlin told Chris Simms that fans should “keep watching” because Allen is still writing his story, pointing to Manning as an example of a quarterback who faced similar criticism before eventually winning a championship.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Photo by Perry Knotts/Getty Images\",\"originalHeight\":1280,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/hitc_articles_832/32345ae1dadfd06325c3be2d374c6ec4.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1920,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/445a8a406646a57ba3a271dddc14f04adde5a790358e025bcab060f2a5fc2c9d/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F32345ae1dadfd06325c3be2d374c6ec4.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b8e10179fd5a278107f0c49c32ff54f6b3ea8fac53e4740cc8441e710975c121/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F32345ae1dadfd06325c3be2d374c6ec4.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"Mike Tomlin’s latest Josh Allen Super Bowl defense leaves NFL fans unconvinced\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/mike-tomlin-latest-josh-allen-081500586.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":142,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Neha Gupta\"],\"brandAlias\":\"insider_monkey\",\"brandUuid\":\"23db486c-cd89-359a-a608-53d73e713d8b\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"originalHeight\":400,\"originalUrl\":\"https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2020-12/a66e33c0-34e4-11eb-9ffe-86f42ff00dbd\",\"originalWidth\":400,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7d7d813f4735527c796dd40ba534c54ae233d9404b0c4a6acb81bcd8b15539cf/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2020-12%2Fa66e33c0-34e4-11eb-9ffe-86f42ff00dbd\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"23db486c-cd89-359a-a608-53d73e713d8b\",\"providerSourceId\":\"insidermonkey.com\",\"showBrandPage\":false,\"source\":\"Insider Monkey\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/insider-monkey/\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"BUSINESS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"4269e598-c1b7-3e2e-b75b-82101b0e1d14-1790498359454\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Business\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"4269e598-c1b7-3e2e-b75b-82101b0e1d14\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:13:24Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"Alibaba Group Holding Limited (NYSE:BABA) is stepping up its artificial intelligence ambitions with a new AI accelerator that the company describes as China’s most powerful. On September 22, it unveiled the Zhenwu V900, an AI chip designed to deliver roughly three times the performance of its predecessor. The announcement comes as Alibaba intensifies its efforts […]\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Alibaba Group Holding Limited (BABA) Takes Aim at Nvidia (NVDA) With New, More Powerful AI Chip\",\"originalHeight\":666,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/insidermonkey.com/c026ccdca6f77118883500c54b4c5b9e.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1000,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7857b72f3b1d798647bb83f9e278d502435ff745abd3e0ae0586b812e5c8f546/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Finsidermonkey.com%2Fc026ccdca6f77118883500c54b4c5b9e.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e0fcc483978a783b766a5917d5ae6dcac7bdd7b47756781e7d1154a970965051/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Finsidermonkey.com%2Fc026ccdca6f77118883500c54b4c5b9e.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"Is Alibaba (BABA)’s AI Investment Strategy Sustainable?\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/alibaba-baba-ai-investment-strategy-081324716.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":270,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"aiSummary\":[{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Luka Doncic told Lakers GM Rob Pelinka to do his job in roster construction, emphasizing his desire to be hands-off in the process.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Many fans interpret Doncic's directive to Pelinka as a potential shot at LeBron James, who is known for being hands-on in roster decisions.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Despite speculation, it is unlikely that Doncic's comments were meant as a direct criticism of LeBron, given their strong personal relationship.\"}],\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Ishaan Bhattacharya\"],\"brandAlias\":\"hitc\",\"brandUuid\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"HITC Logo\",\"caption\":\"HITC Logo\",\"originalHeight\":480,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/hitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"originalWidth\":480,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6db83a642c866802d185948d53aaac192f9ba39995d8e7a19b281ff573de486e/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fhitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"providerSourceId\":\"hitc_articles_832\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"HITC\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/hitc/\",\"description\":\"HITC is a British sport news website focused primarily on football, with coverage extending to Formula 1, NBA, Tennis, and Golf. It was formerly known as Here Is the City and focused on financial news and entertainment before switching to sport in 2023.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"1c653662-0793-3178-87cf-e254e998dc91-1790498359454\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"1c653662-0793-3178-87cf-e254e998dc91\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:12:44Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"Los Angeles Lakers GM Rob Pelinka’s recent revelation of what franchise superstar Luka Doncic told him to do has some NBA fans thinking about LeBron James. LeBron led the Lakers through an eight-year run where they had a lot more success than they get credit for, making six playoff runs and reaching every single stage of the postseason from being first-round exits to winning a championship.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Credit: Jevone Moore/Icon Sportswire/Luke Hales via Getty Images\",\"originalHeight\":1080,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/hitc_articles_832/187c079b377f812b097840b82150c235.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1920,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c19b6d3b2971689fc00858b33a713aa1e49a4c6c37fac1fa369b7dbd00a71412/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F187c079b377f812b097840b82150c235.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e4aa43c6cf2d89cd3b39d66f4342b12c5ffa5b4996753cba5eb06b63e9fe2f28/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F187c079b377f812b097840b82150c235.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"NBA fans feel Rob Pelinka’s Luka Doncic GM clarification is a shot at LeBron James\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/nba-fans-feel-rob-pelinka-081244561.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":162,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Soham Mukherjee\"],\"brandAlias\":\"the_sporting_news\",\"brandUuid\":\"0f040722-7db6-3b5b-839d-8b308c03f8af\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"originalHeight\":400,\"originalUrl\":\"https://s.yimg.com/os/creatr-uploaded-images/2025-07/99afc130-569a-11f0-bfdf-9ad58b40b5c3\",\"originalWidth\":400,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/48fb5e6ac84d50b49e7424c5299434be2c09f36decf4b1d5cccca8359623bd79/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fs.yimg.com%2Fos%2Fcreatr-uploaded-images%2F2025-07%2F99afc130-569a-11f0-bfdf-9ad58b40b5c3\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"0f040722-7db6-3b5b-839d-8b308c03f8af\",\"providerSourceId\":\"the_sporting_news_articles_584\",\"showBrandPage\":false,\"source\":\"The Sporting News\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/the_sporting_news/\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"e09abc11-714b-355c-813b-244f946359cf-1790498359454\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"e09abc11-714b-355c-813b-244f946359cf\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:10:01Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"IND vs WI 1st ODI 2026 live cricket score from Thiruvananthapuram: Check toss winner, ball-by-ball scorecard, win probability, match result, and video highlights.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"originalHeight\":674,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/the_sporting_news_articles_584/b73458a93d22dacf83bd16b60bbd966f\",\"originalWidth\":1198,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e0f0529f0cd7df6c816b3fc2c4d0178b189b610aff8c5d31fa4e6e893abb57f4/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fthe_sporting_news_articles_584%2Fb73458a93d22dacf83bd16b60bbd966f\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cce776b3f38d474e471025c6f97a8fe87d1abac65671f0410962ca498a03c885/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fthe_sporting_news_articles_584%2Fb73458a93d22dacf83bd16b60bbd966f\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"India vs. West Indies live win probability, score, chances of victory for 1st ODI in Thiruvananthapuram\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/india-vs-west-indies-live-075001407.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":86,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"aiSummary\":[{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"A’ja Wilson has chosen to disconnect from the outside world this season to focus on her mental well-being and has excelled on the court, averaging 26.2 points and 9.4 rebounds for the Las Vegas Aces.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Wilson decided to skip Team USA’s FIBA World Cup campaign to rest and prepare for the playoffs, despite criticism, and is now mentally in a better place going into the postseason.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"The WNBA star, who is a contender for MVP and DPOY awards, has separated herself from the limelight to concentrate on her game, with her parents supporting her as she gears up to face the Indiana Fever in the playoffs.\"}],\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Godwin Mathew\"],\"brandAlias\":\"hitc\",\"brandUuid\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"HITC Logo\",\"caption\":\"HITC Logo\",\"originalHeight\":480,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/hitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"originalWidth\":480,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6db83a642c866802d185948d53aaac192f9ba39995d8e7a19b281ff573de486e/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fhitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"providerSourceId\":\"hitc_articles_832\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"HITC\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/hitc/\",\"description\":\"HITC is a British sport news website focused primarily on football, with coverage extending to Formula 1, NBA, Tennis, and Golf. It was formerly known as Here Is the City and focused on financial news and entertainment before switching to sport in 2023.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"c861980c-1685-316d-88f4-760dee697332-1790498359455\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"c861980c-1685-316d-88f4-760dee697332\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:08:15Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"A’ja Wilson has opened up on why she chose to stay away from the limelight of the outside world and how that has helped her this season. The 30-year-old has averaged 26.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Photo by Ethan Miller/Getty Images\",\"originalHeight\":1327,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/hitc_articles_832/33b16086fc6e28133d081154b895ec3f.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1920,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f7f41c458a1d728e5be2419b3aae0ea6f347cc8c1f9333d366fd84b837c8fe3d/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F33b16086fc6e28133d081154b895ec3f.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c8573158aa3cd8cafd5914c6336b50abade57fe3e935097590e41e3e08475cbe/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F33b16086fc6e28133d081154b895ec3f.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"‘It kind of hurts me’ – A’ja Wilson finally reveals why she had been distant from her fans\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/kind-hurts-ja-wilson-finally-080815818.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":114,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"aiSummary\":[{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Texas Longhorns player Colin Simmons penalised for simulating using the restroom during game celebration.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Fans react with mixed opinions on Colin Simmons’ disrespectful celebration, with some calling for stricter punishment.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Simmons apologises post-game, acknowledging his inappropriate behaviour and expressing regret for the distraction caused.\"}],\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Aaditya Krishnamurthy\"],\"brandAlias\":\"hitc\",\"brandUuid\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"HITC Logo\",\"caption\":\"HITC Logo\",\"originalHeight\":480,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/hitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"originalWidth\":480,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6db83a642c866802d185948d53aaac192f9ba39995d8e7a19b281ff573de486e/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fhitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"providerSourceId\":\"hitc_articles_832\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"HITC\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/hitc/\",\"description\":\"HITC is a British sport news website focused primarily on football, with coverage extending to Formula 1, NBA, Tennis, and Golf. It was formerly known as Here Is the City and focused on financial news and entertainment before switching to sport in 2023.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"53460878-1c36-3473-98a7-0e0c4e5a5ed8-1790498359455\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"53460878-1c36-3473-98a7-0e0c4e5a5ed8\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T08:06:58Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"Colin Simmons had quite a lewd celebration during the Longhorns’ win over the Tennessee Volunteers and was punished on the spot. After sacking Tennessee QB Faizon Brandon near the 10-yard line on a third down, Simmons pretended to go to the bathroom on the field.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Photo by David Buono/Icon Sportswire via Getty Images\",\"originalHeight\":1280,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/hitc_articles_832/964d025ef1098cd42a2d19e1976fd8fd.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1920,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20929a29072dfaa0ab94f309b143abab9b181c4293707f1fd6d033f1379b2434/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F964d025ef1098cd42a2d19e1976fd8fd.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/00735c9f4960cd46d03fe3b0a349f9981b23a2f6ba4c0fa46b48cf4ee041ea78/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F964d025ef1098cd42a2d19e1976fd8fd.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"Texas Longhorns fans shocked Colin Simmons’ celebration got the ‘funniest flag in football history’\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/texas-longhorns-fans-shocked-colin-080658688.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":110,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Britney Porter, Contributor\"],\"brandAlias\":\"forbes\",\"brandUuid\":\"0899ea4f-ed96-3f5b-8226-d7e81eccea9e\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Forbes circle\",\"originalHeight\":1435,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/forbes-logo-circle_3139.png_00517e6998734cd4c8bd2beb231ccf4baa30a30aaf1183487804eb559b2c585b.png\",\"originalWidth\":1435,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8fd55a8ef04765e361c2738944bcfec1ce6bc448628568acb1842ed2b35c5d44/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fforbes-logo-circle_3139.png_00517e6998734cd4c8bd2beb231ccf4baa30a30aaf1183487804eb559b2c585b.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"0899ea4f-ed96-3f5b-8226-d7e81eccea9e\",\"providerSourceId\":\"forbes_contributor_845\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"Forbes\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/forbes/\",\"description\":\"Forbes is an iconic global media brand that has symbolized success for over a century. Fueled by journalism that informs and inspires, Forbes spotlights the doers and doings shaping industries, achieving success and making an impact on the world. Forbes connects and convenes the most influential communities ranging from billionaires, business leaders and rising entrepreneurs to creators and innovators.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"BUSINESS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"bc8278bc-cc7e-3dfc-b278-5b07f0c9f1db-1790498359455\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Business\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"bc8278bc-cc7e-3dfc-b278-5b07f0c9f1db\",\"isHosted\":true,