porting News\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/the_sporting_news/\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"27cb4629-c736-30be-8c8a-b6bb75b5b288-1790498359455\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"27cb4629-c736-30be-8c8a-b6bb75b5b288\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T07:49:08Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"Follow Virat Kohli's score today in the India vs West Indies 1st ODI at Thiruvananthapuram. Get runs scored, balls faced, and boundary counts.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"originalHeight\":720,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/the_sporting_news_articles_584/9aa377358c14d8062f009ae182e2992c\",\"originalWidth\":1280,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5a51e79cc3d3cbc1fde9afc3aecf0b645515f95591e51c5efa12b4708585bc62/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fthe_sporting_news_articles_584%2F9aa377358c14d8062f009ae182e2992c\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/03bec5ed69a470a4a041d250900ce5c2d47416bd4ac8a03a8e846f994741c79f/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fthe_sporting_news_articles_584%2F9aa377358c14d8062f009ae182e2992c\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"Virat Kohli score today in India vs. West Indies 1st ODI in Thiruvananthapuram\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/virat-kohli-score-today-india-074908088.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":81,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"aiSummary\":[{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Keyshawn Johnson believes that Shohei Ohtani is a bigger international star than LeBron James, citing Ohtani's success in baseball championships as a key factor.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Despite Ohtani's achievements in MLB, the NBA and LeBron James have a larger global following, with LeBron having significantly more social media followers.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"While Ohtani may be a standout in the MLB, the NBA's worldwide popularity and iconic stars like LeBron James make basketball a more internationally recognized sport.\"}],\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Ishaan Bhattacharya\"],\"brandAlias\":\"hitc\",\"brandUuid\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"HITC Logo\",\"caption\":\"HITC Logo\",\"originalHeight\":480,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/hitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"originalWidth\":480,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6db83a642c866802d185948d53aaac192f9ba39995d8e7a19b281ff573de486e/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fhitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"providerSourceId\":\"hitc_articles_832\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"HITC\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/hitc/\",\"description\":\"HITC is a British sport news website focused primarily on football, with coverage extending to Formula 1, NBA, Tennis, and Golf. It was formerly known as Here Is the City and focused on financial news and entertainment before switching to sport in 2023.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"d98ac067-f799-39d5-a1cf-a2beee92282d-1790498359455\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"d98ac067-f799-39d5-a1cf-a2beee92282d\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T07:45:58Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"Super Bowl XXXVII winner Keyshawn Johnson believes that Los Angeles Dodgers superstar Shohei Ohtani is a bigger international star than the legendary LeBron James. Ohtani has redefined the game of baseball and is on the trajectory to be remembered as the greatest player in the history of the sport.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Credit: Rich von Biberstein/Icon Sportswire/Andy Lyons via Getty Images\",\"originalHeight\":1080,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/hitc_articles_832/7c3c2a30b088a6e0a3fedc19243d06dc.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1920,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0a37882405f8fabd640f64c9ae9f9a8f7238c8177e54ab582786e20ec3432844/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F7c3c2a30b088a6e0a3fedc19243d06dc.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c43dfb3e059fce8875a491319b5687fc6639a9370dc2883bb0978c03359b30ae/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2F7c3c2a30b088a6e0a3fedc19243d06dc.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"Shohei Ohtani has always been a bigger international star than LeBron James, says ex-Super Bowl champion\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/shohei-ohtani-always-bigger-international-074558949.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":110,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"aiSummary\":[{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Freezing banana peels preserves their nutrients and makes them easier to handle for later use in composting.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"To store banana peels in the freezer, rinse them, remove any spoiled parts, freeze them flat on a tray, and then transfer them to a sealed container or bag labeled with the freezing date.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Chopped, frozen banana peels can be used as part of a balanced compost mix to provide potassium and micronutrients for plant growth, but should not be used as the sole fertilizer.\"}],\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Aleem Ahmad\"],\"brandAlias\":\"house_digest\",\"brandUuid\":\"d5599aa5-372e-3313-bb4d-126acc1d7e51\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"house digest favicon icon\",\"caption\":\"house digest favicon icon\",\"originalHeight\":480,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/housedigest-icon-480x480.png_8aca943fc9bcc03e49f1f6a82d1f756d2e9380cf6f1d56166272ce6b7bf87875.png\",\"originalWidth\":480,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d635992ef8d681851ddbf9ab32052adff2e691d813d017919165d56b855e1d10/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fhousedigest-icon-480x480.png_8aca943fc9bcc03e49f1f6a82d1f756d2e9380cf6f1d56166272ce6b7bf87875.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"d5599aa5-372e-3313-bb4d-126acc1d7e51\",\"providerSourceId\":\"house_digest_articles_842\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"House Digest\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/house-digest/\",\"description\":\"At House Digest, we work hard to make sure you can live well. Do you need to know the best color to paint your walls, how to find the right plants for your lifestyle, or just need some celeb home inspo? House Digest gives you everything you need to make your house into a home.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"GOODABLE\",\"type\":\"Contextual\"},{\"id\":\"LIFESTYLE\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"4adefa6a-b61d-382a-a151-aa3b55819c07-1790498359455\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Lifestyle\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"4adefa6a-b61d-382a-a151-aa3b55819c07\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T07:45:00Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"Instead of throwing out your banana peels, try freezing them. Keeping the peels this way preserves their nutrients so you can later use them in the garden.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"originalHeight\":899,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/house_digest_articles_842/b2bcecb194e407260ec49fcd230478f2.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1600,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cc307fd34ded514ee39876ca06646bb8711e1ec4d97584f45f386feccf18aab4/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhouse_digest_articles_842%2Fb2bcecb194e407260ec49fcd230478f2.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6fed264132936b237641747a5f9da8063bc2fafaac512fb3d2f939f67df4d19d/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhouse_digest_articles_842%2Fb2bcecb194e407260ec49fcd230478f2.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"Don't Throw Out That Banana Peel - Put It In Your Freezer For Your Future Garden. Here's Why\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://shopping.yahoo.com/home-garden/gardening/articles/dont-throw-banana-peel-put-171000743.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":191,\"metadata\":{\"ccode\":\"\"}},{\"aiSummary\":[{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"New York Giants RB Cam Skattebo revealed a significant shoulder injury during a livestream, sparking concerns about his future in football.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Skattebo's shoulder has suffered multiple injuries over the years, with fans expressing worry that his career may be cut short due to the severity of the damage.\"},{\"__typename\":\"AISummaryItem\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"With the Giants already facing challenges due to injuries, including losing Jaxson Dart for the season, Skattebo's latest revelation adds to the team's concerns about their prospects not just for this year, but for the long term.\"}],\"attribution\":{\"authors\":[\"Aaditya Krishnamurthy\"],\"brandAlias\":\"hitc\",\"brandUuid\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"image\":{\"altText\":\"HITC Logo\",\"caption\":\"HITC Logo\",\"originalHeight\":480,\"originalUrl\":\"https://d29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net/images/user-uploaded/hitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"originalWidth\":480,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":80,\"width\":80,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6db83a642c866802d185948d53aaac192f9ba39995d8e7a19b281ff573de486e/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w80_h80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fhitc_logo.png_b3c091d244c8dee9d0bbdf832c69df51fedac0865422c9e2ec2f351235f77301.png\",\"tag\":null}]},\"isCreatorContent\":false,\"isOriginalContent\":false,\"providerBrandId\":\"712bfad4-bb3d-4b7d-8f1c-473270c298a1\",\"providerSourceId\":\"hitc_articles_832\",\"showBrandPage\":true,\"source\":\"HITC\",\"brandUrl\":\"https://profiles.yahoo.com/brands/hitc/\",\"description\":\"HITC is a British sport news website focused primarily on football, with coverage extending to Formula 1, NBA, Tennis, and Golf. It was formerly known as Here Is the City and focused on financial news and entertainment before switching to sport in 2023.\"},\"badges\":[{\"id\":\"SPORTS\",\"type\":\"Category\"}],\"bypassModal\":false,\"cacheId\":\"0b73879a-201e-3bc3-99da-deae4b2172c3-1790498359455\",\"categoryLabel\":\"Sports\",\"commentCount\":0,\"contentType\":\"story\",\"id\":\"0b73879a-201e-3bc3-99da-deae4b2172c3\",\"isHosted\":true,\"isLiveLabelSuppressed\":false,\"liveBlog\":false,\"pubDate\":\"2026-09-27T07:41:36Z\",\"slides\":null,\"summary\":\"Cam Skattebo revealed the physical impact of playing football on his shoulder, and fans are worried the New York Giants’ future may have just gone from bad to worse. The Giants have already lost Jaxson Dart to a season-ending knee surgery, forcing John Harbaugh to rely on Jameis Winston as their starting quarterback for the rest of the year.\",\"thumbnail\":{\"altText\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Photo by Brooke Sutton/Getty Images\",\"originalHeight\":1281,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/hitc_articles_832/d63b9a2e40651fdb1e9f1de6d4ce0150.jpg\",\"originalWidth\":1920,\"resolutions\":[{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":286,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ba962e46b4430d2b35db34629b3eed92757739a6fafaa7017fbdd9230930ad07/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w520_h286_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2Fd63b9a2e40651fdb1e9f1de6d4ce0150.jpg\",\"width\":520},{\"__typename\":\"ImageResized\",\"height\":260,\"tag\":null,\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9ebb51c55b402fd9f3ad81ae970a889198ef51b3a8de6b8d70620551c272dc97/lightyear_networkapi/smartcrop_w260_h260_faces%3Bquality_85%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fhitc_articles_832%2Fd63b9a2e40651fdb1e9f1de6d4ce0150.jpg\",\"width\":260}]},\"title\":\"‘Won’t last…’ Giants fans worried about Cam Skattebo after he shows shoulder issue during stream\",\"type\":\"story\",\"url\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/won-t-last-giants-fans-074136795.html\",\"viewCount\":0,\"wpm200\":110,\"metadata